    <div><p class="admin-eyebrow">Inbox / buyer conversations</p><h1>Enquiries <span class="head-count"><?= e($messages['total'] ?? 0) ?></span></h1><p class="admin-lede">A private record of the people and markets asking what comes next.</p></div>
